# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE BUILT DATASET  -  not in git
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# About 4 GB across 370 brackets, and rebuildable from the raw SimJEB files by
# run_1_build_dataset.py. Large generated files do not belong in a repository:
# they make it slow to clone forever, and they are not what anyone reads.
output/graphs/
output/features/

# Any staging copy arranged for a Kaggle upload. It is the same 2.2 GB as
# output/features/ under a different name, and just as unwelcome here. The
# pattern is deliberately broad: a folder like this gets made in a hurry,
# under whatever name suited that day, and one forgotten copy is enough to
# put a gigabyte in a repository permanently.
kaggle_upload*/
*_upload/
*upload_dataset/

# Checkpoints, history and the per-run figures. A checkpoint is a few MB and
# there is one per run. The numbers worth keeping from a run are in
# results.json and per_bracket.csv, which are tiny - copy those in by hand
# when a run is worth recording.
output/runs/


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# KEPT ON PURPOSE  -  do not add these
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# output/split.json      which brackets train / validate / test
# output/scaling.npz     the numbers every input passes through
# output/reports/*.csv   what was excluded, and why
#
# All small, and together they are what makes a result reproducible. A score
# without the split it was measured on is not a claim anyone can check.


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RAW DATA
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The SimJEB files themselves live outside this folder and are pointed at by
# config.py. These patterns are here in case a copy is ever dropped inside.
*.fem
*.vtk
*field.csv
*.zip


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PYTHON AND EDITORS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
